        "id": 1043625
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-21T22:39:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we still need it, because there\u0027s no guarantee that an app that does care about DPF will call setThreadHint (they might only care about thermal and loadChanged, for example). Passing the pgid is a good idea, though.",
      "parentUuid": "cda2a7b7_ce318a9b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 126,
        "startChar": 58,
        "endLine": 126,
        "endChar": 59
